---
description: Backend conventions for FastAPI
globs: backend/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

- Python 3.11+ with type hints on all functions
- FastAPI with async endpoints throughout
- Agents in backend/agents/ — one file per agent (threat.py, route.py, shelter.py, profile.py)
- Cache module in backend/cache.py — in-memory dict with TTL, no Redis
- In Demo Mode (DEMO_MODE=true): load all data from /data/scenarios/2023-west-kelowna/
- Never call external APIs in Demo Mode — all data from static files
- Anthropic API called ONLY in profile.py — nowhere else
- Google Maps API called ONLY in route.py — nowhere else
- All endpoints return JSON matching the contracts in CLAUDE.md